## Ignore some files generated by VSCode
## except some things we might actually need
/.vscode/*
!/.vscode/c_cpp_properties.json
!/.vscode/launch.json

## Ignore clangd index
/.cache/

## Ignore meson build directories
/build/
/build-*/

## Ignore stuff python runtime generates
__pycache__/
*.pyc

## Ignore stuff that QEMU and other scripts
## might emit during debugging sessions
*.log

## Ignore test disk images
*.img
*.iso
